{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/1975886f37e115ee2d1ed409517b989c.avif?t=1773905113\" width=600 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Treeplanter, an interactive woodland that grows and changes with the seasons. Piece together a small grove of trees  and watch as their roots blossom under the soil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time goes by, an ecosystem of animals, plants and birds will move in, turning your creation into a living world. Changing seasons and weather will affect the miniature universe of your grove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/2a4003c32639f9992feee2fc5b3cbd0e.poster.avif?t=1773905113\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/2a4003c32639f9992feee2fc5b3cbd0e.webm?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/2a4003c32639f9992feee2fc5b3cbd0e.mp4?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your grove in a variety of landscapes, from sunny meadows to ancient ruins. Combining meditation and education, Treeplanter aims to teach players about the interconnected wonders of the natural world both above ground and below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each copy of the game sold helps Henry plant trees, wildflowers, meadows and community orchards, through partnerships with schools, farms, communities and woodland charities. Meaning you\u2019ll help <strong>restore real life nature too!!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/cfdd828eda55f804412066b9fb9a0aad.poster.avif?t=1773905113\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/cfdd828eda55f804412066b9fb9a0aad.webm?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/cfdd828eda55f804412066b9fb9a0aad.mp4?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing interactive toybox for fans of games like Summerhouse and Tiny Glade!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together trees with a playful lego-like design!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural creatures turn your grove into a living landscape!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the woodland change and grow throughout the different seasons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the natural world above and below!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/e42a728468c5c3fd7f198de875e2ff27.poster.avif?t=1773905113\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/e42a728468c5c3fd7f198de875e2ff27.webm?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/e42a728468c5c3fd7f198de875e2ff27.mp4?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Please keep in mind that this is a small game with no goals or challenges, created by Henry with  help from his friends - it's all about creating small but beautiful dioramas, using the tools and items from the game alongside the influences of nature :)\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/60907b630118818f403cf9c3ae562843.avif?t=1773905113\" width=600 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531490?t=1773905113","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531490?t=1773905113","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/efd21d6161375eadbfa819516ddc5ca8ebb7253d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773905113","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/efd21d6161375eadbfa819516ddc5ca8ebb7253d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773905113","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4139840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Help plant trees with Treeplanter</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/4b3681faccdb9f0a7bde843cd3a343dd.avif?t=1773905113\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras_big/4b3681faccdb9f0a7bde843cd3a343dd.avif?t=1773905113 width=1560 height=746 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/1975886f37e115ee2d1ed409517b989c.avif?t=1773905113\" width=600 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Treeplanter, an interactive woodland that grows and changes with the seasons. Piece together a small grove of trees  and watch as their roots blossom under the soil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time goes by, an ecosystem of animals, plants and birds will move in, turning your creation into a living world. Changing seasons and weather will affect the miniature universe of your grove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/2a4003c32639f9992feee2fc5b3cbd0e.poster.avif?t=1773905113\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/2a4003c32639f9992feee2fc5b3cbd0e.webm?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/2a4003c32639f9992feee2fc5b3cbd0e.mp4?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your grove in a variety of landscapes, from sunny meadows to ancient ruins. Combining meditation and education, Treeplanter aims to teach players about the interconnected wonders of the natural world both above ground and below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each copy of the game sold helps Henry plant trees, wildflowers, meadows and community orchards, through partnerships with schools, farms, communities and woodland charities. Meaning you\u2019ll help <strong>restore real life nature too!!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/cfdd828eda55f804412066b9fb9a0aad.poster.avif?t=1773905113\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/cfdd828eda55f804412066b9fb9a0aad.webm?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/cfdd828eda55f804412066b9fb9a0aad.mp4?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing interactive toybox for fans of games like Summerhouse and Tiny Glade!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together trees with a playful lego-like design!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural creatures turn your grove into a living landscape!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the woodland change and grow throughout the different seasons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the natural world above and below!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/e42a728468c5c3fd7f198de875e2ff27.poster.avif?t=1773905113\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/e42a728468c5c3fd7f198de875e2ff27.webm?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/e42a728468c5c3fd7f198de875e2ff27.mp4?t=1773905113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Please keep in mind that this is a small game with no goals or challenges, created by Henry with  help from his friends - it's all about creating small but beautiful dioramas, using the tools and items from the game alongside the influences of nature :)\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/extras/60907b630118818f403cf9c3ae562843.avif?t=1773905113\" width=600 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Henry Driver"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531490/71f768dd1f3a725ce2a89ec0601310a44507d9ca/header.jpg?t=1773905113","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531490/1167854713/4fa0f8d12162b0391f0deeff3b19568bb78edb88/1770823283/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770823978","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531490/1167854713/4fa0f8d12162b0391f0deeff3b19568bb78edb88/1770823283/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770823978","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531490/1167854713/4fa0f8d12162b0391f0deeff3b19568bb78edb88/1770823283/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770823978","id":257284607,"name":"Treeplanter - Demo Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257284607/ba13e525b718c32f15901cdb2b8929ac0ca18e8f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770823978"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531490/858253/f5afe47488051398a774b3b2bc3359570c0dbf58/1750858616